<!doctype lake><title>🐿️ 𝓣𝓱𝓸𝓾𝓰𝓱𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="ivWFC" id="ivWFC" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ufedce5a7" id="ufedce5a7">🛸</span><span data-lake-id="u5bda6176" id="u5bda6176">  𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐢𝐧-𝐨𝐟-𝐓𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡𝐭 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐭 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ufd854950" id="ufd854950"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue7faa68b" id="ue7faa68b">大语言模型已在多种复杂推理基准上展现出卓越的性能。这些推理能力通常通过提示技术加以激发，具体包括</span></strong></p><ul list="u88749a73"><li fid="u157b28c7" data-lake-id="u950ecf95" id="u950ecf95"><span data-lake-id="ube3c5377" id="ube3c5377">使用包含中间步骤的示范样例进行少样本提示，或者通过特定指令要求模型展示某些中间步骤，从而实现零样本提示</span></li><li fid="u157b28c7" data-lake-id="ud7055cf9" id="ud7055cf9"><span data-lake-id="u0b5b06dc" id="u0b5b06dc">另一种激发大语言模型推理能力的常用策略，是利用大量思维链推理数据进行模型训练或指令微调</span></li><li fid="u157b28c7" data-lake-id="uffe26f08" id="uffe26f08"><span data-lake-id="u5913fbf4" id="u5913fbf4">尽管提示技术行之有效，但它们通常包含针对特定任务的人类先验，从而使语言模型内在推理能力的评估变得困难。理想情况下，一个训练充分的语言模型应当能够独立推理并给出最优回答，而无需在初始回答不令人满意时，由人类调整提示或反复进行修正</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue7c52b23" id="ue7c52b23"><strong><span data-lake-id="u60b43fbc" id="u60b43fbc" style="color: #DF2A3F">本文从另一种视角出发，提出以下问题：大语言模型能否在无需提示的情况下进行有效推理？它们的推理能力又能达到何种程度？ </span></strong></p><ul list="ub1c68086"><li fid="u48cab527" data-lake-id="u49028f02" id="u49028f02"><span data-lake-id="u550d8343" id="u550d8343">作者发现，仅通过改变解码过程，就能够以一种与任务无关的方式，从预训练大语言模型中激发出 CoT 推理</span></li><li fid="u48cab527" data-lake-id="u029ac31b" id="u029ac31b"><span data-lake-id="u40e30e99" id="u40e30e99">对于给定的推理问题，大语言模型沿标准贪心解码路径生成错误答案；然而，通过考察其他 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kc3av%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf2f9e56" id="ucf2f9e56">候选 token，可以发现模型内在的 CoT 路径，例如解码路径 2 和 4，而这些路径能够正确解决该问题。这种解码调整不依赖提示技术，完全以无监督方式进行，也无需对模型进行微调</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udf9e3b33" id="udf9e3b33" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790971411084-73d1cfaa-a107-443a-bee0-26fdaaa013f3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u05b8ccc6-041c-41ff-8587-1e53407ea4a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2adce271-bd5f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A731.2%2C%22height%22%3A199%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A107992%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A914%2C%22originHeight%22%3A249%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22AVE3APPLES%2CMYDADHAS2MOREAPPLESTHANME%2CSOH%22%2C%22x%22%3A509%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A378%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOUHAVE3APPLES%2CYOURDADHAS2MOREAPPLESTHANYOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A496%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A391%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AS5APPLES.3%2B5%3D8.WEHAVE8APPLESINTOTAL.%22%2C%22x%22%3A499%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A332%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOHEHAS5APPLES.3%2B5%3D8YOUHAVE8APPLESINTOTAL.%22%2C%22x%22%3A497%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A382%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%3ALHAVE3APPLES%2CMYDADHAS2%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOREAPPLESTHANMEHOWMANY%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUESTIONINSTANDARDQAFORMAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A233%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONTINUEGREEDYDECODIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A500%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLESDOWEHAVEINTOTAL%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEHAVE5APPLESINTOTAL.%22%2C%22x%22%3A497%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-3%3AWE%22%2C%22x%22%3A359%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODINGSTEP0%22%2C%22x%22%3A342%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LANGUAGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A197%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NCERTAIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-4%3AYOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEANSWERIS5.%22%2C%22x%22%3A496%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-1%3A5-%22%2C%22x%22%3A357%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CERTAIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A839%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A207%2C%22y%22%3A195%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-5%3ATHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A359%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-2%3A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225APPLES%22%2C%22x%22%3A498%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u46583e80%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8358ed0e" id="u8358ed0e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b7ac2d9" id="u2b7ac2d9">采用标准问答格式组织输入，即 </span></strong><code data-lake-id="u51736a51" id="u51736a51"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc05916e5" id="uc05916e5">Q: [question]\nA:</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id="u7eb4c3e5" id="u7eb4c3e5">。仅依赖贪心解码路径时，大语言模型确实难以有效推理</span></strong></p><ul list="u8d126a6a"><li fid="u46627503" data-lake-id="u74044e8a" id="u74044e8a"><span data-lake-id="u664168d3" id="u664168d3">当考虑 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z7crY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udcd175e7" id="udcd175e7">候选 token 对应的其他路径时，CoT 推理模式会自然地出现在大语言模型的解码轨迹中</span></li><li fid="u46627503" data-lake-id="ue2c83e70" id="ue2c83e70"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34bb8a0d" id="u34bb8a0d" style="color: #5C0036">当解码过程中存在 CoT 推理路径时，模型对最终答案会表现出更高的置信度。利用这一现象，设计一种从 top-</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GX9et%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u63de6d51" id="u63de6d51" style="color: #5C0036">解码路径中进行筛选的方法，称为 CoT-decoding，从而选出最可靠的路径作为模型输出</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5e9dacd6" id="u5e9dacd6"><strong><span data-lake-id="udea56b17" id="udea56b17">提出一项新的发现：无需使用提示，仅通过简单地调整解码过程，大语言模型便能够进行推理。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u617a1e3c" id="u617a1e3c">以往研究主要关注如何改进提示，以激发大语言模型的推理能力；本文首次表明，仅通过简单的解码调整，就能够直接激发推理过程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7ba5055d" id="u7ba5055d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub00e81b5" id="ub00e81b5">能够在不引入人类先验的情况下，更好地理解大语言模型的内在推理能力。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u329e8da8" id="u329e8da8">复杂的提示技术往往引入多种人类先验，使得难以区分模型的表现有多大程度来自人类教学，又有多大程度来自模型自身的独立推理</span></p><p data-lake-id="uaad1ddeb" id="uaad1ddeb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u38cf12ca" id="u38cf12ca">进一步提出 CoT-decoding，依据答案置信度可靠地选择 CoT 路径。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u695d438d" id="u695d438d">当解码路径中包含 CoT 时，语言模型对最终答案的置信度会提高。利用这一置信度提升现象，提出 CoT-decoding，以选择更可靠的解码路径。该方法在多种推理基准上均显著优于贪心解码</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="Xu9LO" id="Xu9LO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub476e194" id="ub476e194">⚓</span><span data-lake-id="uae45db03" id="uae45db03"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fbf6beb" id="u7fbf6beb">𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐢𝐧-𝐨𝐟-𝐓𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡𝐭 (𝐂𝐨𝐓) 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="uc6b5534b" id="uc6b5534b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uffe40f8d" id="uffe40f8d">预训练语言模型无需提示即可进行推理：考察预训练语言模型是否在不依赖显式提示或人工干预的情况下，具备内在的推理能力</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4b72814e" id="u4b72814e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ude636ac9" id="ude636ac9">如果只考虑贪心解码路径，大语言模型确实无法进行推理。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uba249286" id="uba249286">首先，作者观察到，采用贪心解码时，模型的输出往往不包含 CoT 路径，而是直接求解问题</span></p><ul list="u18911cd7"><li fid="u3f926d5a" data-lake-id="ue0ce9580" id="ue0ce9580"><span data-lake-id="u13acfe28" id="u13acfe28">这种倾向可能源于模型对问题难度的认知偏差，而这种偏差又与其预训练过程中接触的问题以较简单的问题为主有关</span></li><li fid="u3f926d5a" data-lake-id="uda717b4d" id="uda717b4d"><span data-lake-id="ua749e0e3" id="ua749e0e3">模型倾向于立即给出解答。这一观察与已有研究的发现一致：即使对于大语言模型，要求直接作答的提示通常也会导致其在推理任务上的准确率较低</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2fdd959b" id="u2fdd959b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u81ca9920" id="u81ca9920">如果考虑其他解码路径，大语言模型便能够进行推理。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u43e3a95a" id="u43e3a95a">相比之下，当在第一个解码步骤中探索其他 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bxa9w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud91c5f97" id="ud91c5f97">候选词元时，会出现一个有趣的现象：从这些词元出发继续执行贪心解码，在许多情况下能够自然地呈现出 CoT 推理。大语言模型在预训练后已经具备完成多种任务所需的内在推理能力，但由于贪心解码占据主导地位，这些能力未能显现。通过引入其他解码路径，可以较为容易地发现这些推理路径</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1bd295d7" id="u1bd295d7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790972245324-4cc879bf-157c-4237-a75f-5d049c3c98a2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua3032f2e-0be3-410e-99db-fd7bb91eea8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7db1b4b0-62a2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A761%2C%22height%22%3A219%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A263341%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1441%2C%22originHeight%22%3A415%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRICE.KYLARWANTSTOBYI6GLASSES.HOWMUCHDOESHENEEDTOPAYJFORTHEMN%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A64%2C%22width%22%3A807%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D7%3ACAGEWASBORMIN1964%2CANEVENYEAR.(0.978)%22%2C%22x%22%3A848%2C%22y%22%3A360%2C%22width%22%3A554%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D0%3ANICOLASCAGEWASBORNINANODDYEAR.(0%22%2C%22x%22%3A846%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A516%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NDTHENSUBTRACT40%25OFTHEPRICEOF8GLASSES.16X5%3D808X5%3D4040X04.%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A335%2C%22width%22%3A819%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D9%3AWECANCALCULATE...WENEEDTOMULTIPLYTHEPRICEOFONEGLASSBYI6%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A797%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BGSM8K%5DONEGLASSCOSTSS5%2CBUTEVERYSECONDGLASSCOSTSONLY609%25OOFTHE%5BYEAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A872%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3D1680-16%3D64KYLARNEEDSTO0PAY%2464FOR16GLASSES.(0.994)%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A724%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D2%3AKYLARNEEDSTOPAY%2460FOR16GLASSES.(0.058)%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A554%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%25OFTHE%5BYEARPARITYWASNICOLASCAGEBORNINANEVENORODD%22%2C%22x%22%3A723%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A685%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D7%3AIFKVLARBUVS16GLASSESHEWILLPAY%24S60(0.032)%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A590%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D1%3A60(0.058)%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A453%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%893%3A1964%2CANEVENYEAR.(0.949)%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A351%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D4%3AHEWASBORNINANEVENYEAR(0.%22%2C%22x%22%3A848%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A412%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALTERNATIVETOP-KPATHS%22%2C%22x%22%3A838%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALTERNATIVETOP-KPATHS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%E4%B8%891%3AEVEN(0.207)%22%2C%22x%22%3A846%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A238%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D2%3A0DD(0.198)%22%2C%22x%22%3A852%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A219%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D0%3A%2460.00(0.029)%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A243%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GREEDYPATH%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GREEDYPATH%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A845%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3FYEAR%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A799%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebebeb%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u86874147%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udea871a0" id="udea871a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uab425ae2" id="uab425ae2">作者观察到，在模型的概率评估中，CoT 路径并不总是排在非 CoT 路径之前。此外，CoT 路径给出的答案往往也不是所有路径中出现次数最多的答案，因此，自一致性等方法在此情形下并不适用</span></strong></p><ul list="u9ddb6477"><li fid="u98db6de7" data-lake-id="ue885ae6a" id="ue885ae6a"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc439553d" id="uc439553d" style="color: #DF2A3F">通过考察模型的 logits，作者发现，CoT 路径的存在通常会使模型在解码最终答案时具有更高的置信度，具体表现为概率最高与次高的两个词元之间存在显著的概率差异</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubc1618c3" id="ubc1618c3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_%7Bk%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Banswer%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Banswer%7D%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bx_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathrm%7Banswer%7D%7D%20p(x_t%5E1%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7B%3Ct%7D)%20-%20p(x_t%5E2%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7B%3Ct%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36c30c6db56f57f64f72678775eb5201.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EANdo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub4181161"><li fid="u08aa5a39" data-lake-id="ua6a351fe" id="ua6a351fe"><span data-lake-id="u540d0c6d" id="u540d0c6d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%5E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4bc6c91d824e0184974cfe83d21f2179.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c9tE0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue526ba86" id="ue526ba86">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c1195b74b4fe92ff050ce87a3118597.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IsC2F%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d424223" id="u0d424223">分别表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gXURt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c992344" id="u8c992344">条解码路径在第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CC0yz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b2fe472" id="u5b2fe472">个解码步骤中，词表内经 softmax 后概率最高和次高的两个词元</span></li><li fid="u08aa5a39" data-lake-id="u9cca465f" id="u9cca465f"><span data-lake-id="u0009e536" id="u0009e536">作者将这一方法称为 CoT-decoding，用于从模型生成的解码路径中提取 CoT 路径。如表所示，每条解码路径均以蓝色标注其对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fw82W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4cfe29f2" id="u4cfe29f2">值，答案词元则以粗体显示。可以明显看出，相较于不包含 CoT 的路径，包含 CoT 的路径具有显著更高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mF7c3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7ea99b6" id="ua7ea99b6">值，表明模型具有更高的置信度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue1070017" id="ue1070017"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc2288c63" id="uc2288c63">标准问答格式下的采样。CoT-decoding 在第一个解码步骤中探索其他候选词元。由此自然产生一个问题：采样能否实现类似的效果，从而发现 CoT 推理路径？作者发现，尽管采样在少样本 CoT 提示下表现良好，但在不使用这些提示时，它并未表现出预期的行为</span></strong></p><ul list="ue93e5344"><li fid="u929746ba" data-lake-id="u0ba02840" id="u0ba02840"><span data-lake-id="uf9a2ec58" id="uf9a2ec58">在不使用 CoT 提示的情况下，CoT-decoding 的样本效率显著高于自一致性等基于采样的方法</span></li><li fid="u929746ba" data-lake-id="u3ff582a5" id="u3ff582a5"><span data-lake-id="u5092a41c" id="u5092a41c">采样效果不佳的原因在于，模型的概率分布偏向于直接作答的词元，因此，与 CoT-decoding 相比，采样得到的首个词元往往缺乏多样性。相比之下，CoT-decoding 通过在第一个解码步骤中显式促进多样性来发挥作用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7d917303" id="u7d917303"><strong><span data-lake-id="u00b5dfb3" id="u00b5dfb3">在其他解码步骤中进行分支。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucca6725e" id="ucca6725e"> 另一个自然的问题是，相较于仅在第一个解码步骤中进行分支，能否在后续解码阶段进行分支。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc7049a95" id="uc7049a95" style="color: #663000">在较早阶段进行分支，例如在第一个解码步骤中进行分支，能够显著提高潜在路径的多样性。相反，较晚阶段的分支会受到先前已生成词元的显著影响</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7fad2fe2" id="u7fad2fe2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790972560738-e9883a10-ab6d-4844-b31c-481539a243cd.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6d91a703-77d6-4d2f-b28d-f4d89580fcc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7db1b4b0-62a2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A863.2%2C%22height%22%3A280%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A66416%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1079%2C%22originHeight%22%3A350%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22IHAVE3APPLES%2CMYDADHAS2MOREAPPLESTHANME%22%2C%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A377%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAVE3APPLES%2CMYDAD...WEHAVE8APPLESINTOTAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A124%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A330%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAVE3APPLES%2CYOURDAD...YOUHAVE8APPLESINTOTAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A138%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A331%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAGEWASBOMIN%3C1964%2CWHICHISANEVENYEAR.%22%2C%22x%22%3A702%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A338%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OWMANYAPPLESDOWEHAVEINTOTAL%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A284%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WASNICOLASCAGEBOMINANEVENORODDYEAR%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A546%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A354%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-DON'TKNOWBECAUSEWEDON'TKNOWHOWMANYAPPLES..%22%2C%22x%22%3A113%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A371%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WASBORNINANEVENYEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A696%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A283%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLESAREAMETAPHOR.%22%2C%22x%22%3A141%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WASBOMINANEVENYEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A297%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAVE5APPLESINTOTAL.%22%2C%22x%22%3A133%2C%22y%22%3A196%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-5%3AHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A540%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-5%3ATHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.%E