x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-1%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-2%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLES%22%2C%22x%22%3A135%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A119%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80N%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8CN%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue7581669%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p>